        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b0a081a-170a-4a62-a35a-8434279e1509).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, your targets are a group of poisonous deadly murderer.\rThis criminal organisation take place in the famous gelateria of Sapienza who exist since the 19th century, but when Michele Inversini become the head of the family affair in 1974, he choose to kill his customers by slow poison, the police investigation lead to none.\rSo your here to take down this slaughter house, your targets are Michele Inversini the initiator, 2 of his kitchen assistant and 2 of his waiter.\rGood luck,47",
